      "text": "Let \\( f \\) be the function that satisfies \\( f'(x) = x - \\left(f(x)\\right)^{2} \\), with \\( f(2) = 2 \\). Find the second-degree Taylor polynomial for \\( f \\) about \\( x = 2 \\)."
