         "step": 1,
         "text": "The relation gives \\( f'(2) = -2 \\). Differentiate the relation, using the chain rule on each term that holds \\( f \\): \\( f'' = - 2 f f' + 1 \\).",
         "mathjson": -2
      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "Evaluate in order at \\( x = 2 \\), feeding each value into the next: \\( f'(2) = -2 \\), \\( f''(2) = 9 \\).",
